    "title": "MICROSERVICE-development-billing-dotnet-api-Create Oidc Token-v1-spec",
    "description": "The OIDC Token Management API facilitates the generation and issuance of OpenID Connect tokens, essential for authenticating users within your application. This service enables developers to seamlessly integrate secure authentication workflows in their applications, providing a crucial mechanism for user identity verification. Typical consumers of this API include application developers and system administrators who require token-based authentication. By utilizing this API, businesses can enhance their security framework and improve user access management.",
